  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 Kral\u0131\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin {{isim}}.\n\nKart\u0131n, ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n i\u015Fleri
    bitirmek i\xE7in \xFCst\xFCn bir \xE7aba sarf etti\u011Fini anlat\u0131yor. Yapamayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFCkleri noktalarda insanlar\u0131 yan\u0131ltm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    \"G\xFCc\xFC yetmez\" diye d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFCkleri konularda kendini fazlas\u0131yla
    ispat edebilmi\u015Fsin. Baz\u0131lar\u0131 yolunu, y\xF6ntemini ve gayretini
    umursamay\u0131p, sonucu g\xF6rmek istemi\u015F. Nihayet istedi\u011Fin sonu\xE7lar\u0131
    da al\u0131p herkese a\u011Fz\u0131n\u0131n pay\u0131n\u0131 vermi\u015Fsin.
    Bu d\xF6nemde dertle\u015Fti\u011Fin ya da yard\u0131m ald\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    bir erkek olmu\u015F olabilir. Bu kart, kazan\u0131mlar\u0131nda o erke\u011Fin
    de rol\xFCn\xFCn b\xFCy\xFCk oldu\u011Funu dile getirmekte."
